{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03566","headline":"春日侍宴幸芙蓉园应制 · 李峤","name":"春日侍宴幸芙蓉园应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年光竹里遍，春色杏间遥。\n烟气笼青阁，流文荡画桥。\n飞花随蝶舞，艳曲伴鸎娇。\n今日陪欢豫，还疑陟紫霄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}